CONTEXT School NAMED Campus INCLUDES Library FROM "library.adl" NAMED Campus
CONTEXT School IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT School
{+ A school and its library on one database, Campus.
The school includes the library, so the application of the school installs that database. +}

-- A member of the library is a person of the school. Person is stored apart from its
-- specialisations, so the table of the members is a table of the library on the database Campus.
CLASSIFY Library.Member ISA Person
REPRESENT Person TYPE MULTITABLE

-- A univalent relation from a concept of the library to a concept of the school,
-- on one database: a column in the table of the members.
RELATION school[Library.Member*SchoolName] [UNI]
REPRESENT SchoolName TYPE ALPHANUMERIC
POPULATION school[Library.Member*SchoolName] CONTAINS [ ("m1", "Het Stedelijk") ; ("m2", "Het Stedelijk") ]

INTERFACE Persons : "_SESSION";V[SESSION*Person] cRuD BOX
  [ "Person" : I cRud
  ]

ENDCONTEXT
